// Wormhole's bundled icon theme. Zed icon theme format (v0.3.0) plus the
// optional "x-wormhole" block, which Zed ignores. Keys in `file_icons` reuse
// Zed's built-in type names where one exists ("terminal", "vcs", "storage", …)
// so Zed themes that only define `file_icons` still pick up these associations.
